# Enterprise Processing Architecture (CO-ARCH-003)

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Permanent · Constitutional

## Principle

Every feature belongs to **exactly one** processing tier.

**No Tier 2 or Tier 3 work may slow a Tier 1 Critical User Journey.**

## Tiers

| Tier | When | Examples |
|------|------|----------|
| **1 — Critical User Journey** | User is waiting | Login, Contacts, Opportunity/Deal open & save, Strategy, Move to Deal, Pipeline, Documents, Lender search/assign, Accounting ops, Tasks |
| **2 — Background** | After commit / idle | Notifications, timeline, audit, search index, cache refresh, messaging, ETE generation, EDC |
| **3 — Enterprise Intelligence** | Scheduled (default overnight) | Scores, EME snapshots, dashboard aggregates, AI insights, leaderboards |
| **4 — Snapshot Consumers** | Page open | Mission Control, CHANAKYA Radar — read certified snapshots only (CO-ARCH-007) |

## Critical path (Tier 1 only)

1. Input validation  
2. Required business validation  
3. Database transaction  
4. Commit  
5. Response to UI  

